<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

  <!--
    RimThunder's heavy casting (its in-game label is "heavy compoment") at Dead Man's Switch: Expedition's rotary forger, in
    batches of 12. Owner's request, 3 Nov 2026; the batch is the owner's call, 6 Nov 2026.

    Why a batch: the forger runs an ordinary recipe (Fortified.Building_WorkTableAutonomous, read 3 and 6 Nov 2026), and its
    colonist waits 300 ticks to load it and 300 to collect, whatever the recipe. For one casting (500 work, 250 ticks on the
    machine) that cost more colonist time than the smelter. Twelve share the same two waits.

    This is a recipe of its own, not RimThunder's CastFromMold with the forger added: the smelter and assembly platform keep
    making one at a time. Same ratio as RimThunder's recipe (100 steel to one casting and one lump of steel slag), times 12,
    and 12 times its work. The products come out as separate things (castings and slag stack to 1), which GenPlace's Near mode
    spreads over nearby cells.

    The recipe is added only when both the forger and RimThunder's recipe exist (two nested conditions, a form
    scripts/check-factory-patches.py can follow), so it never names a missing Def. RimThunder's
    recipe is absent when Aoba.Motorization.Engine is active (RimThunder's StandaloneModule folder doesn't load then). The guard
    needs no load order: the game combines every mod's Defs before it applies any patch (LoadedModManager).
  -->
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="DMSE_TableLathe"]</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationConditional">
      <xpath>Defs/RecipeDef[defName="CastFromMold"]</xpath>
      <match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
        <xpath>Defs</xpath>
        <value>
          <RecipeDef>
            <defName>PhobosForgeHeavyCastingBatch</defName>
            <label>make 12 heavy castings</label>
            <description>Shape 1,200 steel into 12 heavy castings in one run. Also leaves 12 lumps of steel slag.</description>
            <jobString>Forging heavy castings.</jobString>
            <workAmount>6000</workAmount>
            <workSpeedStat>SmeltingSpeed</workSpeedStat>
            <effectWorking>Repair</effectWorking>
            <soundWorking>Recipe_Smelt</soundWorking>
            <uiIconThing>ComponentHeavyCasting</uiIconThing>
            <recipeUsers>
              <li>DMSE_TableLathe</li>
            </recipeUsers>
            <ingredients>
              <li>
                <filter>
                  <thingDefs>
                    <li>Steel</li>
                  </thingDefs>
                </filter>
                <count>1200</count>
              </li>
            </ingredients>
            <fixedIngredientFilter>
              <thingDefs>
                <li>Steel</li>
              </thingDefs>
            </fixedIngredientFilter>
            <products>
              <ComponentHeavyCasting>12</ComponentHeavyCasting>
              <ChunkSlagSteel>12</ChunkSlagSteel>
            </products>
          </RecipeDef>
        </value>
      </match>
    </match>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
